// a local issue anchor — 'dm.ai #601', 'org/repo#N', 'org/repo #N' must NOT
// resolve against the current repo (live: dmtools-dart PR #266 body 'Dart
// port of dm.ai #601' scraped #601 → 'gh issue view 601' 404 → guard exit 1
